# The Linux smoke test's walk through the game (port/smoke/smoke-linux.sh): intro, a new profile,
# settings, the creative-mode mod list, a normal game, saving it, and loading it again from the
# main menu. Positions are window coordinates for the 1080x810 window the device opens on a
# 1920x1080 desktop at scale 1. The clock is fixed at 60 steps a second, so the frames below are game
# time, and the walk plays the same under a software renderer or an emulated CPU.
0 clock 60

# the Oxeye splash fades in over a second, then waits for a key
100 screenshot 01-intro
120 key space

# a fresh ~/.Harvest: the main menu asks for a profile name, typed as text input and pasted with
# Ctrl+V from the clipboard (run.sh puts " Test" there on X11)
400 screenshot 02-new-profile
410 text Smoke
415 key ctrl+v
420 screenshot 03-name-typed
430 click 539 454

# "Would you like to play the introduction?": skip it
500 screenshot 04-introduction-offer
510 click 611 537
600 screenshot 05-main-menu

# Settings, then Done
620 click 322 712
760 screenshot 06-settings
780 click 663 614

# New Game: hover the planet orbiting on the left (the menu picks on motion), then pick it
860 click 536 703
960 move 210 432
962 move 212 432
970 screenshot 07-destinations
980 click 212 432

# the game modes; creative lists the mods: the shipped ones, then ~/.Harvest/mods in byte order
1300 move 619 550
1340 screenshot 08-game-modes
1360 click 619 550
1500 screenshot 09-mods
1510 click 471 628

# a normal game: the dropship lands
1560 move 619 390
1620 click 619 390
2400 screenshot 10-game

# the map scrolls with the wheel (a trackpad's fractions included); Ctrl+T saves Screen-*.jpg
2410 move 540 400
2420 wheel 0 -2.5
2430 wheel 1.5 0
2440 screenshot 11-scrolled
2460 key ctrl+t

# Menu, Save Game, a new slot with a description
2600 click 1025 783
2640 screenshot 12-ingame-menu
2700 click 540 368
2760 click 441 193
2780 click 721 179
2800 click 538 401
2810 text Smoke save
2820 screenshot 13-save-description
2830 click 606 433

# Menu, Exit to the main menu, Load Game, the save, Load
2900 click 1025 783
2960 click 540 461
3220 click 641 705
3340 click 460 195
3360 screenshot 14-load-game
3380 click 721 179
